{"resourceIdentifier":"4558","resourceName":"Xinhangdao AWMS GHG Mitigation Project In Shangqiu City","description":"The project activity uses scraper system to collect the manure automatically. All the manure and wastewater are collected and then be separated first. The separated solid will be treated in aerobic composting system to produce fertilizer The separation liquid is treated by anaerobic digestion, and the biogas generated in the anaerobic digestion process is collected and utilized. Biogas is used as fuel for producing hot water and cooking for pig farms, which eliminated most of methane production and realized methane reduction. and the residual biogas will be flared by internal combustion emergency flare (closed flare) if there is any surplus biogas. The sludge produced by digestion is treated with aerobic composting together with solids, and the effluent is used as liquid organic fertilizer for agricultural irrigation.","location":{"latitude":34.497494,"longitude":116.153508},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-09-11","endExclusive":"2023-10-12","endInclusive":"2023-10-11"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4558"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Xinhangdao Food Co.,Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"42720"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D.,AMS-III.F."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"12/11/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","va